#====================================================================
# DRAFT-E580-libsigc-2-clang-cfg-codesign-werror-probes - OHOS clang cfg injects -Wl,--code-sign breaking Meson -Werror compile probes
#====================================================================

id:                     E2102
trigger_tool:           meson|clang|conan|ohos-toolchain-wrapper
phase:                  build
error_signature:        -Wl,--code-sign: 'linker' input unused|Werror,-Wunused-command-line-argument|gcc_template_specialization_operator_overload.*FAILED|SIGC_TEMPLATE_SPECIALIZATION_OPERATOR_OVERLOAD.*undefined
severity:               2
category:               platform, ohos, meson, compiler, clang-wrapper
match_keywords:         meson, clang, Werror, unused-command-line-argument, code-sign, cfg, OHOS, toolchain-wrapper, compiler-probe, Qunused-arguments
title:                  OHOS clang cfg 注入 -Wl,--code-sign 破坏 Meson -Werror 编译探针 — -Qunused-arguments 对冲
root_cause:             OHOS SDK clang 包装脚本读取 aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos.cfg，将 -Wl,--code-sign 前置到每次 driver 调用；Meson 编译-only 探针带 -Werror=unused-command-line-argument，链接器专用旗标被判为错误，探针误败，上游按降级路径生成 sigc++config.h（SIGC_TEMPLATE_SPECIALIZATION_OPERATOR_OVERLOAD 未定义），模板代码编译失败。
affected_scope:         OHOS cfg 注入环境下使用 Meson -Werror 编译探针的项目（本例 libsigc-2/2.12.2）
verification_cmd:       grep -c 'Qunused-arguments' meson-logs/meson-log.txt; readelf -SW libsigc-2.0.so.0.0.0 | grep .codesign; readelf -d libsigc-2.0.so.0.0.0 | grep -i 'soname\|needed'; meson test
rec_priority:           P1
rec_approach:           conanfile generate() 的 os==OHOS 分支给 tc.extra_cflags/extra_cxxflags 追加 -Qunused-arguments，仅对冲无法剥离的 OHOS cfg 注入；不作全局开关，能在工具链配置层分离编译/链接参数时优先配置层修复并移除本 flag。
rec_command:            tc.extra_cflags.append("-Qunused-arguments"); tc.extra_cxxflags.append("-Qunused-arguments")

principles:             P010
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-E580-libsigc-2-clang-cfg-codesign-werror-probes.md
last_updated:           2026-09-11
source_event:           libsigc-2/2.12.2 本地适配：Meson 探针失败 → -Qunused-arguments 对冲修复，全测试通过
authors:                libsigc-2-adapter
source_pr:
source_commit:

metrics_success_count:  0
metrics_fail_count:     0
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_description:        conanfile generate() 的 os==OHOS 分支给 tc
